xt", "content": "Practice your dialogue with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Change roles."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue of 8 - 10 lines about a strange situation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice the dialogue with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I change roles in a dialogue about a situation."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le04ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le04ob03re2img06.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le04ob03re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Hello???  Peter??? Are you ok?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Oh hi Vanessa, you're home!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  What happened?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Well, I was in a taxi. We got into an accident with a couple of cable cars and a lot of angry tourists.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  How did that happen?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le04ob03re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: We went the wrong way on Lombard Street. It was a very steep hill. We didn't see the cable cars coming.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Where are you now?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, I'm not really sure.  I'm in a police station. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: When are you coming?", "id": 2, "time": "21000", "image": "engenn5le04ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, there are some nice police officers here. They told me I can leave in a few hours.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Why do you have to wait?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: They have some questions for me and I have to fill out a report.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Oh, Peter!", "id": 3, "time": "35200", "image": "engenn5le04ob03re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk or report about  actions, events or people."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can ask questions using words like what, when, how."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about general quantities using words like some and many. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Were you in an accident? When?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What happened?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "You won't believe what happened!"}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 0, "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 1, "selected": 0, "id": 1}]}], "stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "type": "STI", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Peter tells Vanessa what happened since he arrived in San Francisco